<title>USA: TENNIS-BAUSCH &amp; LOMB CHAMPIONSHIPS WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BAUSCH &amp; LOMB CHAMPIONSHIPS WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>AMELIA ISLAND, Florida 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>$450,000 Bausch &amp; Lomb Championships women's tennis tournament</p>
<p>on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>9-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Sarah Pitkowski (France) 6-3</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>11-Mary Pierce (France) beat Elena Wagner (Germany) 6-0 6-1</p>
<p>13-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Adriana Gersi</p>
<p>(Czech Republic) 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>14-Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) beat Tami Whitlinger Jones</p>
<p>(U.S.) 2-6 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Angeles Montolio (Spain) beat Emanuel Gagliardi (Switzerland)</p>
<p>2-6 6-4 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Alexandra Fusai (France) beat Larisa Neiland (Latvia) 6-2 7-6</p>
<p>(7-0)</p>
<p>Jana Kandarr (Germany) beat Cristina Torrens-Valero (Spain)</p>
<p>6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Second Round</p>
<p>2-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) beat Florencia Labat</p>
<p>(Argentina) 3-6 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>4-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat Joanette Kruger (South</p>
<p>Africa) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>5-Anke Huber (Gerrmany) Beat Radka Zrubakova (Slovakia) 6-2</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>6-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Shi-Ting Wang (Taipei) 6-2</p>
<p>6-0</p>
